over-blocking control); existing planned-path assertions moved to
canonical comparisons so the suite is portable to macOS.

Java parity (AGENTS.md rule 2): spec is FileTools.java in epam/dm.ai
(normalize + containment, "Path traversal attempt blocked"); lexical
Path.normalize() BEFORE containment kept as-is, symlink resolution kept
stronger than Java's (Java resolves via toRealPath only when the entry
exists; the ancestor walk extends that to planned paths without
weakening the rejection side). Files.walk followLinks parity recorded
above.

