79:/// ancestor and appends the non-existent remainder lexically, so planned
80:/// writes (final component not on disk yet) still see through symlinked
81:/// parents — the symlink-escape hole and the macOS `/var` → `/private/var`
82:/// first-write false rejections share this root cause (gh-365 rework:
83:/// a fully lexical fallback left symlinked ancestors unresolved while
